# 02 — Test Doubles, Fixtures & Assertion Quality

<!-- GEN: Why: mocking the wrong boundary or writing tautological assertions makes green tests prove nothing. Kind: Mandatory — keep the purpose, adapt the structure (core/authoring-guide.md). -->

Rules **U1**, **U4**, **U5**, **U6**, **U7**, **U8**, **U9**, and **U11**.

